  "title": "India's MSME and Reit Sector Growth Amid AI and Investment",
  "summary": "State Bank of India (SBI) uses AI to underwrite nearly ₹1 lakh crore in MSME loans during FY26, improving fraud detection and customer care. Six listed Indian Reits reported a Rs 3,136 crore distribution during Q1 FY27, marking a significant investment in the sector. A retired transport officer arrested for recovering Rs 35 crore in assets faces charges related to financial misconduct. NITI Aayog and the IIM Ahmedabad report highlights the mixed impact of PLI schemes on employment and MSME gains.",
